{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"tm_title","type":"text","text":"# Taskmaster AI\n\n**Philosophy:** Task-first — \"The PM for your AI agent\"\n**Creator:** Eyal Toledano\n**Install:** `npm install -g task-master-ai`\n**MCP:** `claude mcp add taskmaster-ai -- npx -y task-master-ai`\n**Runtime:** Multi-provider (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, Mistral, Groq, Ollama, +more)","x":200,"y":-480,"width":600,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_group","type":"group","x":-400,"y":-220,"width":1800,"height":340,"color":"4","label":"Workflow: PRD → Parse → Tasks → Execute"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_1","type":"text","text":"## 1. Initialize\n\n`task-master init`\n\nCreate project structure:\n- `.taskmaster/` directory\n- Configuration files\n- Template setup\n\nWrite detailed PRD at:\n`.taskmaster/docs/prd.txt`\n\nPRD quality = task quality","x":-380,"y":-170,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_2","type":"text","text":"## 2. Parse PRD\n\n`task-master parse-prd`\n\nConvert requirements\nto actionable tasks:\n- Auto-decomposition\n- Dependency detection\n- Priority assignment\n- Subtask generation\n\nAI-driven interpretation\nof natural language PRD","x":-80,"y":-170,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_3","type":"text","text":"## 3. Navigate Tasks\n\n`task-master list` — All tasks\n`task-master next` — Priority pick\n`task-master show [IDs]` — Details\n\nHierarchical organization:\n- Main tasks\n- Subtasks within tasks\n- Dependencies tracked\n- Status per task\n\nComma-separated IDs\nfor batch operations","x":220,"y":-170,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_4","type":"text","text":"## 4. Execute & Track\n\n`task-master move` — Stage transition\n`task-master research [query]` — Context\n\nMove tasks between stages\nwith dependency checking:\n- Prevents broken deps\n- Auto-validates consistency\n- Cross-tag movement\n\nResearch gathers info\nwith project context","x":520,"y":-170,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_5","type":"text","text":"## 5. Expand & Refine\n\n\"Expand task [number]\"\n\"Help me implement task [N]\"\n\nBreak complex tasks into\nfiner subtasks on demand\n\nAI chat interactions:\n- \"What's next?\"\n- \"Parse my PRD at [path]\"\n- \"Show tasks [1,2,3]\"\n- \"Research [topic]\"\n\nLong-term context maintained","x":820,"y":-170,"width":280,"height":260,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"tm_wf_6","type":"text","text":"## Rules Integration\n\n`task-master rules add`\n\nIntegrate additional\nAI assistant frameworks:\n- Import external rules\n- Combine with other tools\n- Extend capabilities\n\nLayerable on top of\nother frameworks","x":1120,"y":-170,"width":260,"height":260,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tm_providers_group","type":"group","x":-400,"y":180,"width":880,"height":320,"color":"5","label":"Multi-Provider Architecture"},
		{"id":"tm_prov_1","type":"text","text":"## Supported Providers\n\n- **Anthropic** (Claude)\n- **OpenAI** (GPT)\n- **Google Gemini**\n- **Perplexity**\n- **xAI** (Grok)\n- **OpenRouter**\n- **Azure OpenAI**\n- **Mistral**\n- **Groq**\n- **Ollama** (local)","x":-380,"y":230,"width":260,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tm_prov_2","type":"text","text":"## Three Model Roles\n\n**Main** — Primary task processing\nBest model for complex reasoning\n\n**Research** — Information gathering\nCan use specialized research models\n\n**Fallback** — Backup when main fails\nCheaper model for resilience\n\nConfigure via `.env` or\nMCP environment variables\n\nOptimizes cost vs capability","x":-100,"y":230,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tm_prov_3","type":"text","text":"## MCP Tool Loading\n\n`TASK_MASTER_TOOLS` env var:\n\n**\"all\"** (~21,000 tokens)\n36 tools, complete feature set\n\n**\"standard\"** (~10,000 tokens)\n15 tools, typical operations\n\n**\"core\"** (~5,000 tokens)\n7 essential daily tools\n\n**Custom** — Name specific tools\n\nContext budget management\nvia progressive disclosure","x":220,"y":230,"width":300,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"tm_files_group","type":"group","x":520,"y":180,"width":880,"height":320,"color":"3","label":"Project Structure & Integration"},
		{"id":"tm_files","type":"text","text":"## File Structure\n\n```\nproject-root/\n├── .taskmaster/\n│   ├── docs/\n│   │   └── prd.txt      # Requirements\n│   ├── templates/        # Task templates\n│   └── config            # Settings\n├── .env                  # API keys\n└── tasks/                # Task files\n    ├── task-001.yaml\n    ├── task-002.yaml\n    └── ...\n```\n\nTasks in structured YAML format","x":540,"y":230,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"tm_editors","type":"text","text":"## Editor Integration\n\nMCP configuration for:\n- **Cursor** — `.cursor/mcp.json`\n- **Windsurf** — MCP settings\n- **VS Code** — Extension config\n- **Q Developer CLI** — AWS integration\n- **Claude Code** — Direct MCP add\n\n## Key Claims\n\n- 90% coding error reduction\n- Long-term context maintenance\n- Prevents context loss in\n  large-scale projects\n- Dependency auto-validation","x":960,"y":230,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"tm_diff","type":"text","text":"### Key Differentiator: Task management focus (not spec-driven) · Multi-provider with 10+ AI backends · Three-role model config (main/research/fallback) · Progressive tool disclosure via TASK_MASTER_TOOLS · Layerable on top of other frameworks via `rules add`","x":-400,"y":560,"width":1800,"height":60,"color":"6"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"tm_e1","fromNode":"tm_title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tm_wf_group","toSide":"top"},
